#: ../../tools/ensembl_info_tools.rst:63 519d5776c9bf49899ca6ea6cee43a6d8
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search and list species available in the Ensembl "
"database with their genome assembly information. Returns species name, "
"common name, taxonomy ID, current assembly version, and Ensembl division."
" Supports filtering by species name, common name, or taxonomy ID. Useful "
"for discovering which genomes are available and their assembly versions "
"before querying other Ensembl endpoints. Example: searching 'mouse' "
"returns Mus musculus (taxon 10090, assembly GRCm39) plus related species."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ensembl_info_tools.rst:67 a806889e4aed49afbe1a243f25aa23d4
msgid ""
"``search`` (string) (optional) Search term to filter species. Can be a "
"species name ('mus\\_musculus'), common name ('mouse'), display name "
"('Mouse'), or taxonomy ID ('10090'). Leave empty to list all 348+ "
"species."
msgstr ""

